                                        "entry_id": "809c1657-378c-3387-bd96-fb1429ceee53",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "reminiscent of the action of electricity: thrilling, shocking, dramatic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cc147c8-002d-4e11-8d7e-8be7441b2ba9",
                                                "sense_id": "10559b39-530c-3672-8c5c-a6a8052e8d1a",
                                                "text": "Around them, the air thrummed with the kind of voltaic wailing to power up the darkest night."
                                            }
